ed_paths":["instrumentation/pulsar/pulsar-2.8/javaagent/build.gradle.kts","instrumentation/pulsar/pulsar-2.8/javaagent/src/version5Test/java/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/instrumentation/pulsar/v2_8/PulsarClientV5Test.java"],"commit":"da855574e07afcad14ae84c525b8ad831a6db251","commits":[{"changed_paths":["instrumentation/pulsar/pulsar-2.8/javaagent/build.gradle.kts","instrumentation/pulsar/pulsar-2.8/javaagent/src/version5Test/java/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/instrumentation/pulsar/v2_8/PulsarClientV5Test.java"],"commit":"da855574e07afcad14ae84c525b8ad831a6db251","parent":"b745fc7c82eed59583eb47a5caed1a3d1127b1f9","patch_sha256":"019c5719b6a3239e9a90ee566409181f9f0635c90200bc5e438d72bd2deed903","subject":"Avoid duplicate test fixtures in Pulsar v5 suite","tree":"67e2e204af0514a43ce52f64fba786ba540030c9"}],"cumulative_patch_sha256":"019c5719b6a3239e9a90ee566409181f9f0635c90200bc5e438d72bd2deed903","finding_commits":{"inline:4242802437":"da855574e07afcad14ae84c525b8ad831a6db251","review:5484520504":"da855574e07afcad14ae84c525b8ad831a6db251"},"parent":"b745fc7c82eed59583eb47a5caed1a3d1127b1f9","patch_sha256":"019c5719b6a3239e9a90ee566409181f9f0635c90200bc5e438d72bd2deed903","tree":"67e2e204af0514a43ce52f64fba786ba540030c9"},"dispositions":{"findings":[{"analysis":"The overview summarizes the same duplicate-test and broker-fixture problem as the inline finding. Candidate commit 1 makes PulsarClientV5Test inherit PulsarClientTest and limits version5Test to that subclass. JUnit dry-run discovery confirms one concrete v5 class with all 16 inherited legacy methods and its v5 parameterized template, with no duplicate base methods.","commit":1,"disposition":"fixed","key":"review:5484520504"},{"analysis":"The frozen suite compiled src/test/java and src/version5Test/java and excluded only the suppression class, selecting both PulsarClientTest and PulsarClientV5Test. Both inherited four base tests and the broker lifecycle. Candidate commit 1 selects only PulsarClientV5Test, now extending PulsarClientTest, so it retains every legacy test and the synchronous/asynchronous v5 cases while using one inherited fixture lifecycle. Actual JUnit dry-run reports contain exactly that subclass and every inherited method once.","commit":1,"disposition":"fixed","key":"inline:4242802437"}],"input_identity":{},"outcome":"fixes","request_digest":"4e44b1d3477d313692704d29db06ce7f41d688a8708e9e8ad1e91d12f71553b9","schema":2},"download_sha256":"5e4d6245898eaa86eed4960a2faba7f85eac23663ff6589a3d0932d4f7aac447","frozen_sha":"b745fc7c82eed59583eb47a5caed1a3d1127b1f9","pr":20452,"publication_eligible":false,"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","request_digest":"4e44b1d3477d313692704d29db06ce7f41d688a8708e9e8ad1e91d12f71553b9","request_id":"67e44c4aa5b9492892abe6fd9f980b35","run_attempt":1,"run_id":38199854425,"schema":2,"scope":"Structural/Git verification only. No target code or tests are executed.","server_artifact_digest":"sha256:5e4d6245898eaa86eed4960a2faba7f85eac23663ff6589a3d0932d4f7aac447","verification":"verified","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":38201323852},"workflow_revision":"ad6a64e8dc14135373bf97b7702ff40449bb2704"},"request":{"authorized_actor_id":218610,"baseline_review_ids":[5484246391,5484520504],"budgets":{"max_iterations":5,"propagation_seconds":120,"retention_days":14,"worker_timeout_minutes":30},"commit_author":{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"findings":[{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nThe v5 suite duplicates inherited tests and starts an unnecessary additional Pulsar broker.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>1 open finding</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Avoid duplicate inherited tests and broker startup in V5 suite](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20452#discussion_r4242802437) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nAdds Pulsar client v5 integration coverage for issue #20407 while retaining existing 2.8/4.x coverage.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Adds synchronous and asynchronous v5 producer/consumer tests.\n- Adds v5 dependencies, Muzzle coverage, broker selection, and Java 17 gating.\n- Registers the suite in CI and latest-dependency configuration.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `PulsarClientV5Test.java` | Tests v5 messaging APIs and telemetry propagation. |\r\n| `AbstractPulsarClientTest.java` | Selects a compatible broker image. |\r\n| `build.gradle.kts` | Configures v5 dependencies, Muzzle, and test suite. |\r\n| `.github/\u200bscripts/\u200binstrumentations.sh` | Adds the v5 suite to CI. |\r\n| `.github/\u200bconfig/\u200blatest-dep-versions.json` | Pins the latest v5 client artifact. |\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n---\n\n\ud83d\udca1 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5484520504","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5484520504},{"body":"[Testing] This suite discovers both `PulsarClientTest` from `src/test/java` and `PulsarClientV5Test`; because both extend `AbstractPulsarClientTest`, JUnit runs the four inherited tests twice and starts a separate Pulsar broker for each class. This adds a costly duplicate container/test cycle. Consider making the v5 class extend `PulsarClientTest` and filtering this suite to execute only that subclass, so it inherits the legacy coverage and adds the v5 cases in one fixture lifecycle.","comment_commit_id":"b745fc7c82eed59583eb47a5caed1a3d1127b1f9","comment_id":4242802437,"key":"inline:4242802437","kind":"inline","line":37,"original_commit_id":"b745fc7c82eed59583eb47a5caed1a3d1127b1f9","original_line":37,"path":"instrumentation/pulsar/pulsar-2.8/javaagent/build.gradle.kts","review_commit_id":"b745fc7c82eed59583eb47a5caed1a3d1127b1f9","review_id":5484520504,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-11T19:00:38Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"aeee17401e7c0c31e7e05b6894e28d6e7db0cb960b4d4b62bf848c0856ea168d","id":4242802437,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-11T19:00:38Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86rQgs1"}],"frozen_at":1791775661,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-12T03:27:41Z","frozen_sha":"b745fc7c82eed59583eb47a5caed1a3d1127b1f9","head_ref":"copilot/add-tests-for-pulsar-client-v5","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":38199819598},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","metadata":{"body":"<!--\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\na deprecation or breaking change.\n-->\n\nPulsar 5 introduces a new API and changes the dependency needed for the retained legacy API. Existing coverage stops at 4.x.\n\n- **Coverage:** Add `version5Test`, reusing legacy tests and exercising synchronous/asynchronous v5 producer and queue-consumer APIs. Assert message IDs, span attributes, and propagated trace links.\n- **Runtime:** Use `pulsar-client-v5-all`, compile-only Swagger annotations, and a v5 broker. Gate the suite on Java 17 while preserving 2.8/4.x coverage.\n- **Integration:** Register the suite in `check` and CI; add v5 Muzzle coverage and the dependency-version pin.\n\nThe two broker versions preserve transaction coverage. The 2.8 client lacks the coordinator-connect handshake required by newer brokers, while the v5 API requires a 5.x broker.\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT SUFFIX -->\n\n- Fixes #20407","title":"Add Pulsar client v5 integration coverage"},"mode":"publish","pr":20452,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791775663,"generation":7,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"8d036810ccce4a2f8bab81df10bc1075","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","repo_id":210933087,"request_id":"67e44c4aa5b9492892abe6fd9f980b35","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/ad6a64e8dc14135373bf97b7702ff40449bb2704","workflow_revision":"ad6a64e8dc14135373bf97b7702ff40449bb2704"},"run":{"attempt":1,"conclusion":"success","id":38199854425,"url":"https://github.com/trask/copilot-workflows/actions/runs/38199854425"},"schema":2,"seen_findings":["e3987e5e18a395921694121dc115fdc229272223bc979a9522c111ce2d860c05"],"seen_inline_findings":["c4354bb9a3014a027cc2387b8214d42b4eacc129613fb40b293012be4f9c13ab"],"seen_missed_findings":[],"stage":"publication_intent","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":38201323852}}